      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I'll write the improved test with better variable naming, clearer comments, and removal of unused imports/constants.Now I'll compile-check the generated test.The improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes unused imports (`assertFalse`, `fail`, `EOFException`) and the unused `MARK_RESET_NOT_SUPPORTED` constant, replaces the ambiguous `position` variable with a clearer `charsBeforeMark` constant and `markPosition` named variable, standardizes the initial for-loop form, and improves comments to better describe each test phase — all while preserving identical runtime behavior."
